  "_doc": "The firmware corpus (corpus/README.md, docs/firmware.md): raw firmware images for several processors, built from source by corpus/firmware/build.py in the toolchain image (corpus/firmware/docker/Dockerfile). Each image is a flat binary (objcopy -O binary) with a known load address and entry, kept beside its ELF (DWARF) as ground truth. 'targets' are fwkit's per-processor build settings; 'images' are what gets built.",
